/*
  MaintenanceBanner.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0127 · MaintenanceBanner (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The keys mirror the web source
  (components/feedback/MaintenanceBanner.tsx) one-for-one — the maintenance / degraded titles, the
